  "subject": "an ordinary man drawn by lot as citizen judge number six (Taiwan's citizen judge system) for a six-day fraud trial, who may tell no one, tells his wife it's a business trip, eats cold pork-chop lunchboxes in silence with five strangers, and casts his vote",
  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien post-punk in the Irish and British 2020s revival style. A wiry clean trebly guitar riffing in tight repeated figures; a driving melodic bass carrying the hook; tight dry snare and fast closed hi-hat; a second guitar scraping chords. Dry, cold, close-miked live-room mix with the bass loud. A flat male baritone, half-spoken and dry, rising to a shouted chorus. 150 BPM, E minor. Deadpan, tense and quietly dutiful. No synth pop, no pop-punk chorus, no autotune, no trap drums, no metal growls.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n一張批寄來 紅色的印\n我的名 予電腦抽著\n六工 愛去法院報到\n毋通講 毋通錄 毋通問\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n我共牽手講 公司欲出差\n伊共我的領帶 扭予正\n\n[Chorus]\n我是國民法官 六號\n坐佇第二排 正手爿\n我是國民法官 六號\n規工 喙合牢牢\n\n[Verse]\n檢察官講 三百萬\n被告講 伊毋知影\n證人講 伊袂記得\n我共筆記簿 寫甲滿滿\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n中晝便當 排骨冷冷\n六个人 無人敢開喙\n\n[Chorus]\n我是國民法官 六號\n坐佇第二排 正手爿\n我是國民法官 六號\n排骨冷去 嘛食了了\n\n[Verse]\n第五工 評議門關起來\n法官問我 你按怎看\n我想著阮老爸 予人騙過\n我講證據 我閣看一擺\n\n[Bridge]\n我舉手 我投票\n我的名 無人會知\n\n[Chorus]\n我是國民法官 六號\n散會矣 我轉去做家己\n我是國民法官 六號\n牽手問我 出差順序無\n\n[Outro]\n我講普通普通 爾爾",
